  "headline": "Twenty-one maintenance doors. The three that say how much they will destroy say a different number from the one that gets destroyed, the seeding controls are the only class in the app with a correct double gate, and the single most dangerous control in the group is a function called prune that empties the whole table when its input list is empty.",
